9	// Codegen emits the graph-derived C# files. The static skeleton (csproj,
10	// Program.cs, AGENTS.md) comes from the system-host template; everything the
11	// component graph shapes is generated here so it is testable against golden
12	// files and regenerable by a future `system sync`. Generated files are owned
13	// whole-file: one builder call per line, one statement per component,
14	// blank-line separated — the diff-friendly shape a regeneration reproduces.
